  dialogueManager: {fileID: 1682790333}
  spellSelectionScreen: {fileID: 0}
  battleScreen: {fileID: 0}
  element: 
  totalNumOfElementSpells: 0
  battleCanvas: {fileID: 1932909322}
  eventSystem: {fileID: 0}
  initalLines:
  - Oh hey! Ready for an electrifying experience?
  - Get it? Because this is an electric-type classroom?
  - "Take your time to prepare yourself\u2014and don\u2019t forget to set down anything
    that might get singed or short circuited!"
  - Huh?
  - "Usually we have a video to demonstrate\u2026looks like something\u2019s gone
    wrong though."
  - "You\u2019ll be just fine! You just need to dodge the bolts. Good luck!"
  afterPuzzleLines:
  - "How hair-raising\u2026good job!"
  - I want to get in on this action.
  - "Time for your final exam. Be careful\u2014I\u2019ve been working out!"
  afterBattleLines:
  - If we ever spar again, use one of these spells next time.
  afterSpellLines:
  - Keep up the energy and that fighting spirit!
